      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8889,
      "back_translation": "飞机能在天空中飞行，是因为工程师运用了很多物理知识。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.75,
      "back_translation": "飞机的机翼是经过特别设计的。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7027,
      "back_translation": "飞机向前跑的时候，空气从机翼的上下两侧流过。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7778,
      "back_translation": "机翼上方的空气流得快，下方的空气流得慢。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.6857,
      "back_translation": "这产生了一个向上的力，我们称之为“升力”。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8462,
      "back_translation": "升力使飞机离开地面，飞向天空。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8462,
      "back_translation": "但是空气也会阻挡飞机前进的路。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7826,
      "back_translation": "这个阻挡飞机的力叫作“阻力”。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.5333,
      "back_translation": "阻力使飞机减速。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7719,
      "back_translation": "所以飞机的形状必须做得光滑，这样空气才能顺畅地流过，阻力也就减小了。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8636,
      "back_translation": "发动机的作用是产生向前的推力，帮助飞机克服阻力。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8148,
      "back_translation": "在飞行过程中，工程师必须让升力、阻力、推力和重力这四种力保持平衡。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9565,
      "back_translation": "如果升力太大，飞机就会上升；如果升力太小，飞机就会下降。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7027,
      "back_translation": "如果推力不够，飞机就会减速，甚至可能无法移动。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9286,
      "back_translation": "所以飞行员和工程师都必须懂得这些物理原理，才能让飞机安全飞行。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8,
      "back_translation": "现代飞机设计需要大量的工程计算和风洞实验。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 16,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7692,
      "back_translation": "工程师先做一个小模型，把它放进风洞里往上吹风，看空气是怎样流过的。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 17,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9143,
      "back_translation": "他们观察升力和阻力的变化，然后改进设计。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 18,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9565,
      "back_translation": "这个过程要重复很多次，直到飞机飞得又快又稳又安全。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 19,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8462,
      "back_translation": "虽然飞行看起来很复杂，但实际上全都由简单的物理定律控制。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 20,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7027,
      "back_translation": "一旦我们理解了这些定律，就能造出更好的飞机。"
    }
  ]
